The ledgers live here, one .jsonl per agent, written at runtime.

This file is tracked so the directory exists in a fresh checkout. It is not
decoration: vintos-bench.service names this path in ReadWritePaths=, and systemd
refuses to start a unit whose ReadWritePaths= does not exist (226/NAMESPACE). With
ProtectHome=read-only the service cannot create it either. A pull that did not carry
this directory was a service that never came up and a blank page on her phone.
